Personal Finance Copilot
📌 Project Overview

Personal Finance Copilot is an AI-powered web application that helps users track, analyze, and manage their personal finances. It provides spending insights, budgeting tools, financial goals, and an AI assistant for personalized financial analysis.

🎯 Client Requirements
Secure user registration and authentication.
Add, edit, delete, and categorize income/expenses.
Import transactions through CSV/Excel.
Automatically categorize transactions.
Display an interactive financial dashboard.
Provide spending and income analytics.
Create and monitor monthly budgets.
Detect unusual spending patterns.
Identify recurring expenses and subscriptions.
Set and track financial goals.
Provide AI-powered financial insights and natural-language queries.
Forecast future spending and savings.
Generate financial reports.
Send budget and spending notifications.
Protect user financial data with proper security and authorization.
🚀 MVP Features
 User Authentication
 Transaction Management
 CSV Import
 Expense Categorization
 Financial Dashboard
 Budget Management
 Spending Analytics
 AI Financial Assistant
 Spending Anomaly Detection
 Financial Goals
🛠️ Suggested Tech Stack

Frontend: React / Next.js
Backend: FastAPI
Database: PostgreSQL
AI: OpenAI API
ML/Data: Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn
Charts: Recharts
Deployment: Vercel + Render/Railway
